<title>JAPAN: Peregrine launches samurai in two tranches - Nikko.</title>
<headline>Peregrine launches samurai in two tranches - Nikko.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following two tranches of samurai bond issues by Peregrine Investment Holdings were announced by lead manager Nikko Securities on Tuesday:</p>
<p>Tranche 1:</p>
<p> AMT		 10 bln yen</p>
<p> COUPON	    2.60 pct</p>
<p> MATURITY	  30 June 2000</p>
<p> ISS PRICE	 par</p>
<p> PAY DATE	  30 June 1997</p>
<p> SUB PERIOD	June 17 to June 27</p>
<p> PAY FREQ	  Semi-annual</p>
<p> LAST RATING     JBRI BBB+</p>
<p> LEAD MANAGER    Nikko Securities</p>
<p> LEAD TRUSTEE    Nikko Trust and Banking</p>
<p>Tranche 2:</p>
<p> AMT		 10 bln yen</p>
<p> COUPON	    0.90% plus 6-mth yen LIBOR</p>
<p> MATURITY	  20 June 2000</p>
<p> ISS PRICE	 par</p>
<p> PAY DATE	  20 June 1997</p>
<p> SUB PERIOD	June 17 to June 19</p>
<p> PAY FREQ	  Semi-annual</p>
<p> LAST RATING     JBRI BBB+</p>
<p> LEAD MANAGER    Nikko Securities</p>
<p> LEAD TRUSTEE    Nikko Trust and Banking</p>
<p>-- Tokyo Treasury Desk +81-3-3432-8785</p>
</text>
